# The landing page is a static folder and the Vercel project's Root Directory is
# `apps/web`, so nothing else in this monorepo needs uploading. Without this a
# CLI deploy archives the build output too — contracts/target, the Android build
# and node_modules came to 1.9 GB and the upload failed outright.
#
# A whitelist rather than a list of offenders: a new build directory somewhere
# should not silently start being uploaded again.
/*
!apps
apps/*
!apps/web

# Nothing below apps/web is generated today, but this keeps it that way.
apps/web/node_modules
